                    marking.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d179-f2" n="2" xml:id="d179-f2-content">
                <p>No record of such a meeting has been found. A meeting was scheduled for September
                    28 but not held. Rostow’s briefing memorandum for the
                    meeting is at the Johnson Library. (Bromley
                        Smith Papers, Memos Written by Mr. Smith,
                    Signed by Others)</p>
            </note>
